{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56037","headline":"游兼山 · 周渭","name":"游兼山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"插空峭壁白云迷，独上高巅万象低。\n一路接天连楚界，两峰拔地镇南夷。\n泉飞石涧游魂冷，风卷松涛匹马嘶。\n踏破层崖心未折。\n凤凰山後鹧鸪啼。\n（见光绪十五年陆履中纂《恭城县志》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"周渭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56037.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56037","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}